OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe after shopkeeper
OL,4,Afends off machete-wielding robber
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shopkeeper has described how he
OL,7,Finitially thought a robber who came
OL,8,Finto his shop in broad daylight
OL,9,Fbrandishing a machete was "a prank".
OL,11,FBikrant Malhotra was working in the Day
OL,12,FToday store on Alloway Road in East
OL,13,FKilbride when the incident happened.
OL,15,FHe told BBC Scotland News that at first
OL,16,Fhe thought the knife was fake, but
OL,17,Fafter the man started hitting a few
OL,18,Fthings it seemed "pretty real".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
