OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe after shopkeeper
OL,4,Afends off machete-wielding robber
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland have appealed for any
OL,7,Fwitnesses of the incident at about
OL,8,F12:30 on Monday 17 August to contact
OL,9,Fthem.
